OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour installs 800 poppies to
OL,4,Ahonour war dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of poppies will be displayed
OL,7,Fin Folkestone as part of Remembrance
OL,8,Fevents in a town that played a key role
OL,9,Fduring two world wars.
OL,11,FA total of 800 large red commemorative
OL,12,Fpoppies will be installed among the
OL,13,Fflowerbeds and lower track area of the
OL,14,FOld Harbour Station in Folkestone to
OL,15,Fremember those who died in World War
OL,16,FOne.
OL,18,FTraders at Folkestone Harbour Arm
OL,19,Fposted on Facebook that the poppies
OL,20,Fwill be displayed from Saturday,
OL,21,Falongside a special exhibition in
OL,22,FCustoms House.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
