OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour installs 800 poppies to
OL,4,Ahonour war dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement on social media said
OL,7,Fmillions of people passed through
OL,8,FFolkestone Harbour during World War
OL,9,FOne. The poppies and exhibition will
OL,10,Fremain on display until Wednesday.
